y operates as a school nurse. In truth, he is a sadistic entrepreneur who studies dark sorceries and devotes tremendous resources into criminal activities such as arms smuggling. Seishirou seeks nothing less than the power of a god, and will do anything to seize it: Heaven have mercy on the poor souls who dare stand in his way."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From Nargrakhan's review"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c18725"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"霊ヶ岳学院の保健医。しかしそれは表の顔でしかなく、実際は莫大な資産を持つ巨大コングロマリット企業の総帥であり、またその昔、召喚した地獄の魔王アスモデウスを取り込んだ魔王の力をも持つ、人間を超越した存在。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"17052","sourceWorkId":"1986","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"ひょんなことから、風間に娘の世話を頼まれる。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"もちろん、悪魔すら従わせるこの男がまともに世話をするわけもなく……。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"17052","sourceWorkId":"2598","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"本編主人公。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"普段は霊ヶ岳学院学園の保健医だが、実は莫大な資産を持つ巨大コンチェルン「緒方グループ」の総帥。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"退屈な日常に終止符を打ちたいと考えている。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"17052","sourceWorkId":"5035","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"職業：霊ヶ岳学院（たまがおかがくいん）保健医"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"特技：悪魔使い"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"見た目は普通の人間で、むしろ優しげ。普段は霊ヶ岳学院学園の保健医だが、"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"実態は莫大な資産を持つ資産家。裏では軍事兵器の密売にも関わっている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"退屈な日常に終止符を打ちたいと考えている。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"77089"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/c9/c96259c0c03413d39d4be45e0c1e1c8184b718af02eb8844a698720a94df8ea2.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/7a/7ae476237fbcf3a137cdf432dff8d97a9dabed2105f1f44382a25beb41d037e3.webp","width":166,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_c41864","characterName":"風間 琴子","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"77088","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"66684"}],"egsCharacterIds":["17050"],"vndbCharacterId":"c41864"},"originalCharacterName":"風間 琴子","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"本作のヒロイン。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"星四郎の勤める学院の学生。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"まだ転入したばかり。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"17050","sourceWorkId":"2598","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"本作のヒロイン。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"星四郎の勤める学院の学生。まだ転入したばかり。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"77088"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/cf/cfacf8f27c85a989bf886c765fe7576a7d38add3b6b05d3734ef0f5b9ae9e26f.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/c2/c235004a81d16bca749fdd98a4bd3228ff3b2adf13e187ee837b144a901e84bc.webp","width":219,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"春日 りか","creatorId":"vndb:s1622","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s1622","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s1622","name":"春日 りか","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:17791","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_c41869","characterName":"白木沢 綾","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"77090","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"68254"}],"egsCharacterIds":["17051"],"vndbCharacterId":"c41869"},"originalCharacterName":"白木沢 綾","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"bust":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"70"},"height":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"146"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Aya is from a mysterious lineage that from occasion to occasion, produces offspring with staggering magic potential. For this present generation, she is that individual. Despite her duties, Aya is still a child at heart, and possess an angel like innocence. Being an only child, she regrets not having an elder brother to rely on."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Hobby: Making candy"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Talent: Sports"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Likes: Elder brothers"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Dislikes: Insects"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From Nargrakhan's review"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c41869"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"内閣直属特殊事態特別対策室所属のエキスパートの一人。A班所属。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"西洋魔術を操る。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"魔術的見地からの検証を行う必要のある事例は少ないので、主にメンバーのサポートが任務。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"かつて大陸から渡ってきた魔術師が残したといわれる魔導書と杖を代々受け継ぐ家に生まれ、現在は綾が受け継いでいる。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"綾の両親を含めほとんどの先祖は魔導を形式的なものとし、信じていなかったが、綾は類まれなる才能と努力で物理的な現象を引き起こせるほどに解明、行使が可能。だが内面はまだまだ子供で、チームのマスコット的存在。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"とても良い子である。兄弟がおらず、兄のような存在に憧れている。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"17051","sourceWorkId":"1986","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"星四郎の忠実な下僕。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"琴子の調教を行う際は、助手を務める。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"主に調教の手伝いで登場。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"17051","sourceWorkId":"2598","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"職業：高山学園（学年はヤバそうだからナシ：笑）、特対室A班所属"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"所属部：特になし"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"趣味：お菓子作り"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"特技：スポーツ・運動全般"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"好きなもの：兄のような存在感のある男性（ようは兄属性：笑）"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"嫌いなもの：虫全般、特にゴキブリ・蜘蛛"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"『対策室』A班のメンバーで、西洋魔術を操る。魔術的見地からの検証を行う必要のある事例は少ないので、"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"主にメンバーのサポートが任務。かつて大陸から渡ってきた魔術師が残したといわれる魔導書と"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"杖を代々受け継ぐ家に生まれ、現在は綾が受け継いでいる。綾の両親を含めほとんどの先祖は"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"魔導を形式的なものとし、信じていなかったが、綾は類まれなる才能と努力で物理的な現象を"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"引き起こせるほどに解明、行使が可能。だが内面はまだまだ子供で、チームのマスコット的存在。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"とても良い子である。兄弟がおらず、兄のような存在に憧れている。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"77090"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/70/700629fbb6f582191f1fbe7301e913942b856ba02ed53811840d0da0d6163363.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/27/275970a8c6fc6474c5e4c649f1a89ea3bff66878e14337c65f16cc80a8b15654.webp","width":171,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"小倉結衣","creatorId":"vndb:s267","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s267","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s267","name":"石原 愛依梨","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:66684:77090:5936:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c44055","characterName":"榎本　クリス","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"123179","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"276152"},{"characterId":"123179","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"68254"}],"egsCharacterIds":["17054"],"vndbCharacterId":"c44055"},"originalCharacterName":"榎本　クリス","characterNameSource":null,"role":"appears","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"bust":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"81"},"height":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"160"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Chris is a full blooded American, yet due to her unusual upbringing, was raised in Japan. She is an overwhelmingly powerful psychic, yet fears her own abilities for the potential devastation they could cause. As such, Chris has few friends and is somewhat cold to others. She conceals what Gypsies identify as an “Evil Eye.”"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Hobby: None"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Talen